    <string name="setup_header">Termux Installation Helper</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_title">1. Configure Termux Permissions</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_desc">Ensure your Termux properties allows external apps. In Termux, run:\n\necho "allow-external-apps = true" >> ~/.termux/termux.properties\ntermux-reload-settings\n\nAlso grant "Run commands in Termux" permission in Android App Info -> Advanced Permissions.</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_title">2. Automate Environment Build</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_desc">This step automatically downloads Python, Git, and system libraries inside Termux, clones the plain-ub repository, generates the config.env, and installs the required core package (with dual mode support if selected).</string>
